FS_SCAN_REQUIREMENTS_V1
# All native physical constraints participate in SQP and final replay.
# The desired schedule uses 56 J including 8 J from the fixed background.
energy 0 4 48 1
power 0 1 * 40 1
state 2 0 temperature_k * 311 1
peak 1 4 liquid_mass_fraction 0.8 1 0.001 all
# Only source 1 has continuous linear power and position tables.
slew 1 50 20 1
speed 1 0.1 1
